			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					We used AI to generate additional chat message ideas based on the initial list we made ourselves. Relevant message ideas were added to the game, some messages were altered to fit, and rest were left on the cutting room floor.				</i>
			</p>
